<p>    Soybean Meal ---- 1996/97		 1995/96</p>
<p>    -		09/01/96  08/01/96  09/01/96  08/01/96</p>
<p> Ending Stocks	 200	 225	  225     275</p>
<p> Average Price    245-265   235-270    235.00   230.00</p>
<p>Note-Soymeal Average Price in dollars/short ton, simple average of 48 pct, Decatur. Soyoil Average Price (cents/lb) is simple average of crude soyoil, Decatur. Total Supply includes imports. 1994/95 soyproduct production estimates are based on October year crush of 1,403 million bu. Soy products marketing seasons begin Oct 1.</p>
